        <item>
            <title>Pastry 2.0.0</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 05:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/balajeein/Pastry/releases/tag/v2.0.0</link>
            <sparkle:version>1</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.0.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>11.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>What's New in Pastry 2.0.0</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Text & Image Shortcuts</strong>: Instant snippet and image expansion at your cursor with ⌥ + Space.</li>
                    <li><strong>Native macOS UI Redesign</strong>: Authentic macOS design language and streamlined interaction.</li>
                    <li><strong>Sparkle 2 Auto-Updates</strong>: Seamless background updates directly from GitHub.</li>
                    <li><strong>Performance Improvements</strong>: Universal binary built natively for Apple Silicon and Intel.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
